@host = http://localhost:5000

### Create an order (201 + Location)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Jane Doe",
  "product": "Mechanical keyboard",
  "amount": 349.90
}

### Order details (moves to Processing and, 5 s later, Completed)
GET {{host}}/orders/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### List orders
GET {{host}}/orders

### Invalid data (400 with per-field errors)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "",
  "product": "Mouse",
  "amount": 0
}

### Unknown order (404)
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### AI module: enabled?
GET {{host}}/orders/ask/status

### AI module: question (503 if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not set)
POST {{host}}/orders/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many orders are pending?"
}

### Health: process
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Health: API + PostgreSQL + Service Bus
GET {{host}}/health/ready
